  "question": {
    "text": "Rank the following compounds in decreasing order of reactivity in electrophilic aromatic substitution reaction<br />\r<img src=\"assets\\qt0043_810ca806789c.jpeg\" style=\"width:5.15in;height:1.225in\" />"
